      "message": "feat(ui): tool kind glyphs on the Tool library catalog rows and the tool picker\n\nEach Tool library catalog row and each operation page tool picker item\nnow wears its kind's existing tool-* glyph at 16 px, before the unchanged\nlabel. The picker keeps its selected-tool glyph beside the combo.\n\nRefs #661\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
